[engl]
{100}{}{Theresa}
{200}{}{You see Theresa.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{water chip done}
{1020}{}{water chip ongoing}
{1030}{}{rebels initiated -  meeting time}
{1040}{}{rebels not started}
{1050}{}{rebellion quest failed}
{1060}{}{rebels initiated -  meeting out of time}
{2000}{}{I didn't think you would succeed, but you did a good job. Thank you for saving us all.}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{Please hurry and find the water chip. We cannot wait much longer.}
{3010}{}{Don't worry, I will.}
{3020}{}{Hoooot!}
{4000}{}{Welcome to our meeting! As you have been picked by the Overseer to go outside, perhaps you can give us some advice before our move to the outdoors as well.}
{4010}{}{Hoooot!}
{4020}{}{Don't drink glowing water.}
{4030}{}{Yeah . . . don't go.}
{4040}{}{I think that your plans to leave are ill-advised.}
{5000}{}{Thank you so much. I can see you're going to be a big help. Why don't you just leave?}
{5010}{}{Fine then.}
{5020}{}{Sorry, I'm here to hear all of this.}
{6000}{}{It's only a matter of time before we run out of water here. But the Vault was never
meant to keep people inside forever! We have the people and the supplies to move outside
now. We have a better chance.}
{6010}{}{Outside is too dangerous.}
{6020}{}{The Vault was made to release its inhabitants together as a group, not as a small band
that will be quickly overwhelmed.}
{7000}{}{Really? Considering our position, our lack of water, and the original purpose of this Vault, why do you think that we should stay?}
{7010}{}{It's just a bad idea, is all.}
{7020}{}{The outside world is too dangerous to the unprepared. It's best to have time to make
proper preparations before going. The Overseer is trying to give the Vault that needed
time.}
{8000}{}{If you can't give us good reasons why we shouldn't leave, then we're not going to wait here and die of water poisoning. Please don't get in our way.}
{8010}{}{Very well. It's your choice.}
{8020}{}{Sorry, folks, I can't let you do this.}
{9000}{}{We're well-prepared now. We have equipment and simulator training. A few hazards outside are better than dying slowly of thirst!}
{9010}{}{Well, good luck then.}
{9020}{}{Sorry, I can't let you leave now.}
{10000}{}{We've been over this before. Leave us alone.}
{10010}{}{[Done.]}
{11000}{}{Well, considering that you have some experience with the outside, perhaps you have some
valuable points to make.}
{11010}{}{I just need a little more time to find the water chip.}
{11020}{}{The outside is too dangerous and hostile. You wouldn't last long.}
{12000}{}{Hello, how fares your journey?}
{12010}{}{It's going pretty well, thanks.}
{12020}{}{Not very well.}
{12030}{}{Hoogh!}
{13000}{}{It's good to hear that. I knew that the outside world couldn't be as bad as everyone says. I mean, our ancestors lived outside, right? But that paranoid Overseer won't let us leave.}
{13010}{}{The Overseer probably has his reasons.}
{13020}{}{Actually, it's pretty bad out there.}
{13030}{}{You're right; the outside world isn't all that bad.}
{13040}{}{The Overseer is simply trying to protect us. The outside world is dangerous to the 
unprepared.}
{14000}{}{And I suppose he chose you to go outside because he knew that you were under his thumb! He really just doesn't want to give up his control over us.}
{14010}{}{I resent that remark!}
{14020}{}{Actually, I think he believes that there's no reason to risk survival outside while it's still safe in here.}
{14030}{}{Actually, I think he believes that there's no reason to risk survival outside while it's still safe in here.}
{15000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Theresa02a']}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa08]}
{15020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa09]}
{15030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa25]}
{16000}{}{I suppose. I always figured that he just had some sort of power trip. But I guess that he wouldn't be the Overseer if he wasn't really concerned about our welfare, would he? I guess we should just wait and see if you can find the chip.}
{16010}{}{Don't worry, I'll take care of it.}
{17000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{17010}{}{[Done.]}
{18000}{}{Oh, come on! Wake up! If he thinks the outside is so dangerous, then how come he sent you out there? The man just has a control complex. You're a stupid tool and you don't
even know it!}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{Hmm. From what I've read, the outside isn't really all that dangerous. But I suppose that you would know better than I, wouldn't you?}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{I knew that the outside couldn't be too bad. That's why I've been trying to convince some people to come outside with me. I think that we have a better chance of survival out there.}
{20010}{}{What are you smoking!?}
{20020}{}{That's probably a good idea.}
{21000}{}{Oh, get real! Do you really think that we can live in this Vault generation after generation? Maybe you can find a new chip, but what happens when the next thing breaks down? And the next?}
{21010}{}{Maybe we can't stay here forever. But rushing out into the world without preparation and
without the consent of the group isn't the answer.}
{21020}{}{Huh. I guess you're right.}
{22000}{}{A lot of us think so. That's why we're planning to take some supplies and head out in a few days. Say, do you have any advice for us?}
{22010}{}{Sorry, I haven't really found much out there.}
{22020}{}{You could head to this little village called Shady Sands, a few days east. They might 
help.}
{22030}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{Okay. Well, thanks.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. I hope that you're able to find the chip soon.}
{24010}{}{With all of the hazards I've been running in to, it may take some time.}
{24020}{}{Shouldn't be a problem.}
{25000}{}{Hmm. I suppose it was too much to hope that the outside world had taught you to communicate. Oh well.}
{25010}{}{[Done.]}
{26000}{}{Oh, just go away! We don't need the help of one of the Overseer's pawns!}
{26010}{}{[Done.]}
{27000}{}{Come back later, we have a lot to discuss...}

